--- !u!114 &1920031604
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1920031576}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a6c0b27261178404d8abc29e10789abe, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::TutorialController
  pasos:
  - textoES: 1. Hi! I'm Eliane Tremblay, and this is MY adventure at the house on
      Hollow Street. I'm going to teach you how to play, okay? Let's have a blast!
    textoEN: "Hola! Soy Eliane Tremblay, y esta es MI aventura en la casa de Hollow
      Street. Te voy a ense\xF1ar a jugar, \xBFvale? \xA1Vamos a pasarlo genial!"
    audioES: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1aa9f4200093ba141a5dd1cbf18e004f, type: 3}
    audioEN: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1aa9f4200093ba141a5dd1cbf18e004f, type: 3}
    condicion: 0
    parametro: 
    delaySegundos: 0
    soloDropCorrecto: 0
    elementoAResaltar: {fileID: 0}
    tipoResaltado: 0
    direccionFlecha: 0
    botonEsperado: {fileID: 0}
    bloqueoFondo: 1
  - textoES: '2. This game uses Augmented Reality, which means we''ll see everything
      through your phone''s camera. It''s like opening a magic window into the story!

'
    textoEN: 
    audioES: {fileID: 0}
    audioEN: {fileID: 0}
    condicion: 0
    parametro: 
    delaySegundos: 0
    soloDropCorrecto: 0
    elementoAResaltar: {fileID: 0}
    tipoResaltado: 2
    direccionFlecha: 0
    botonEsperado: {fileID: 0}
    bloqueoFondo: 0
  - textoES: 3. Just a moment... I'm waking up the magic camera.
    textoEN: 
    audioES: {fileID: 0}
    audioEN: {fileID: 0}
    condicion: 14
    parametro: 
    delaySegundos: 3
    soloDropCorrecto: 0
    elementoAResaltar: {fileID: 0}
    tipoResaltado: 0
    direccionFlecha: 0
    botonEsperado: {fileID: 0}
    bloqueoFondo: 0
  - textoES: '4. This game works with special cards. You need to have them printed
      out, or on another screen. If you don''t have them yet, download them in thetremblay.com/downloads '
    textoEN: 
    audioES: {fileID: 0}
    audioEN: {fileID: 0}
    condicion: 0
    parametro: 
    delaySegundos: 0
    soloDropCorrecto: 0
    elementoAResaltar: {fileID: 0}
    tipoResaltado: 0
    direccionFlecha: 0
    botonEsperado: {fileID: 0}
    bloqueoFondo: 0
  - textoES: 5. Look for the 2  cards that say "TUTORIAL." Those are the ones we'll
      use now. Point your camera at one of them, like you're about to take its picture.
    textoEN: 
    audioES: {fileID: 0}
    audioEN: {fileID: 0}
    condicion: 1
    parametro: ITVela
    delaySegundos: 0
    soloDropCorrecto: 0
    elementoAResaltar: {fileID: 0}
    tipoResaltado: 0
    direccionFlecha: 0
    botonEsperado: {fileID: 0}
    bloqueoFondo: 0
  - textoES: 6. Look! A candle <sprite name="vela"> or appeared on the card.
    textoEN: 
    audioES: {fileID: 0}
    audioEN: {fileID: 0}
    condicion: 0
    parametro: 
    delaySegundos: 3
    soloDropCorrecto: 0
    elementoAResaltar: {fileID: 0}
    tipoResaltado: 0
    direccionFlecha: 2
    botonEsperado: {fileID: 0}
    bloqueoFondo: 0
  - textoES: 7. You can tap objects right on the screen when they appear. Try it!
      Tap the candle <sprite name="vela">.
    textoEN: 
    audioES: {fileID: 0}
    audioEN: {fileID: 0}
    condicion: 2
    parametro: vela_tutorial
    delaySegundos: 0
    soloDropCorrecto: 0
    elementoAResaltar: {fileID: 0}
    tipoResaltado: 0
    direccionFlecha: 0
    botonEsperado: {fileID: 0}
    bloqueoFondo: 0
  - textoES: 8. Did you hear how it's said in Spanish? If you want to hear it again,
      tap the button I'm pointing at.
    textoEN: 
    audioES: {fileID: 0}
    audioEN: {fileID: 0}
    condicion: 0
    parametro: 
    delaySegundos: 0
    soloDropCorrecto: 0
    elementoAResaltar: {fileID: 0}
    tipoResaltado: 0
    direccionFlecha: 0
    botonEsperado: {fileID: 0}
    bloqueoFondo: 0
  - textoES: "9. You can listen to it as many times as you want \u2014 I did too
      when I was learning! Just tap the button again."
    textoEN: 
    audioES: {fileID: 0}
    audioEN: {fileID: 0}
    condicion: 6
    parametro: 
    delaySegundos: 0
    soloDropCorrecto: 0
    elementoAResaltar: {fileID: 2070265773}
    tipoResaltado: 0
    direccionFlecha: 0
    botonEsperado: {fileID: 2070265775}
    bloqueoFondo: 0
  - textoES: 10. Now let's save this object so we can use it later. Tap the button
      I'm showing you to save it in your inventory.
    textoEN: 
    audioES: {fileID: 0}
    audioEN: {fileID: 0}
    condicion: 8
    parametro: 
    delaySegundos: 0
    soloDropCorrecto: 0
    elementoAResaltar: {fileID: 907288049}
    tipoResaltado: 0
    direccionFlecha: 0
    botonEsperado: {fileID: 907288051}
    bloqueoFondo: 0
  - textoES: 11. Awesome, it's yours now!
    textoEN: 
    audioES: {fileID: 0}
    audioEN: {fileID: 0}
    condicion: 0
    parametro: 
    delaySegundos: 0
    soloDropCorrecto: 0
    elementoAResaltar: {fileID: 0}
    tipoResaltado: 0
    direccionFlecha: 0
    botonEsperado: {fileID: 0}
    bloqueoFondo: 0
  - textoES: '12. Now you can close it by tapping here. Remember: whenever you want
      to see an object again, just point the camera at it and tap it.'
    textoEN: 
    audioES: {fileID: 0}
    audioEN: {fileID: 0}
    condicion: 9
    parametro: 
    delaySegundos: 0
    soloDropCorrecto: 0
    elementoAResaltar: {fileID: 1368369808}
    tipoResaltado: 0
    direccionFlecha: 0
    botonEsperado: {fileID: 1368369810}
    bloqueoFondo: 0
  - textoES: 13. Go ahead and save the other object that appeared too.  Point your
      camera at the other card you found.
    textoEN: 
    audioES: {fileID: 0}
    audioEN: {fileID: 0}
    condicion: 1
    parametro: ITCalabaza
    delaySegundos: 0
    soloDropCorrecto: 0
    elementoAResaltar: {fileID: 0}
    tipoResaltado: 0
    direccionFlecha: 0
    botonEsperado: {fileID: 0}
    bloqueoFondo: 0
  - textoES: 14. Hey, I see you found the pumpkin! <sprite name="calabaza"> It's
      one of my favorites.
    textoEN: 
    audioES: {fileID: 0}
    audioEN: {fileID: 0}
    condicion: 2
    parametro: calabaza_tutorial
    delaySegundos: 0
    soloDropCorrecto: 0
    elementoAResaltar: {fileID: 0}
    tipoResaltado: 0
    direccionFlecha: 0
    botonEsperado: {fileID: 0}
    bloqueoFondo: 0
  - textoES: 15. Save it in your inventory, just like we did with the candle <sprite
      name="vela">.
    textoEN: 
    audioES: {fileID: 0}
    audioEN: {fileID: 0}
    condicion: 8
    parametro: 
    delaySegundos: 0
    soloDropCorrecto: 0
    elementoAResaltar: {fileID: 907288049}
    tipoResaltado: 0
    direccionFlecha: 0
    botonEsperado: {fileID: 907288051}
    bloqueoFondo: 0
  - textoES: "16. Perfect! Now close the panel \u2014 I want to show you something
      really important."
    textoEN: 
    audioES: {fileID: 0}
    audioEN: {fileID: 0}
    condicion: 9
    parametro: 
    delaySegundos: 0
    soloDropCorrecto: 0
    elementoAResaltar: {fileID: 1368369808}
    tipoResaltado: 0
    direccionFlecha: 0
    botonEsperado: {fileID: 1368369810}
    bloqueoFondo: 0
  - textoES: 17. See the pumpkin <sprite name="calabaza"> down there? I'm pointing
      at it. You can tap it, or swipe up to open your inventory. Try it!
    textoEN: 
    audioES: {fileID: 0}
    audioEN: {fileID: 0}
    condicion: 10
    parametro: 
    delaySegundos: 0
    soloDropCorrecto: 0
    elementoAResaltar: {fileID: 496359013}
    tipoResaltado: 0
    direccionFlecha: 2
    botonEsperado: {fileID: 496359015}
    bloqueoFondo: 0
  - textoES: '18. Look! Here are the two objects you saved: the candle <sprite name="vela">
      and the pumpkin <sprite name="calabaza">. They''re both yours now.'
    textoEN: 
    audioES: {fileID: 0}
    audioEN: {fileID: 0}
    condicion: 0
    parametro: 
    delaySegundos: 0
    soloDropCorrecto: 0
    elementoAResaltar: {fileID: 0}
    tipoResaltado: 0
    direccionFlecha: 0
    botonEsperado: {fileID: 0}
    bloqueoFondo: 0
  - textoES: 19. Up top there's a mission. I know you might not fully understand
      what it says yet, but I bet you can guess which objects it's asking for.
    textoEN: 
    audioES: {fileID: 0}
    audioEN: {fileID: 0}
    condicion: 0
    parametro: 
    delaySegundos: 0
    soloDropCorrecto: 0
    elementoAResaltar: {fileID: 2007938555}
    tipoResaltado: 2
    direccionFlecha: 0
    botonEsperado: {fileID: 0}
    bloqueoFondo: 1
  - textoES: 20. Drag the candle <sprite name="vela"> to the spot where it belongs.
      If you don't remember how to say "candle <sprite name="vela">" tap the green
      button next to it to hear it again.
    textoEN: 
    audioES: {fileID: 0}
    audioEN: {fileID: 0}
    condicion: 3
    parametro: 
    delaySegundos: 0
    soloDropCorrecto: 0
    elementoAResaltar: {fileID: 0}
    tipoResaltado: 0
    direccionFlecha: 0
    botonEsperado: {fileID: 0}
    bloqueoFondo: 0
  - textoES: 21. That's how it's done!
    textoEN: 
    audioES: {fileID: 0}
    audioEN: {fileID: 0}
    condicion: 0
    parametro: 
    delaySegundos: 0
    soloDropCorrecto: 0
    elementoAResaltar: {fileID: 0}
    tipoResaltado: 0
    direccionFlecha: 0
    botonEsperado: {fileID: 0}
    bloqueoFondo: 0
  - textoES: 22. Now drag the candle <sprite name="vela"> and the pumpkin <sprite
      name="calabaza">, each one to its place.
    textoEN: 
    audioES: {fileID: 0}
    audioEN: {fileID: 0}
    condicion: 3
    parametro: 
    delaySegundos: 0
    soloDropCorrecto: 0
    elementoAResaltar: {fileID: 0}
    tipoResaltado: 0
    direccionFlecha: 0
    botonEsperado: {fileID: 0}
    bloqueoFondo: 0
  - textoES: 23. You're doing great! Now tap the button I'm pointing at to check
      if you placed them right.
    textoEN: 
    audioES: {fileID: 0}
    audioEN: {fileID: 0}
    condicion: 12
    parametro: 
    delaySegundos: 0
    soloDropCorrecto: 0
    elementoAResaltar: {fileID: 1780003069}
    tipoResaltado: 0
    direccionFlecha: 0
    botonEsperado: {fileID: 0}
    bloqueoFondo: 0
  - textoES: "24. Yesss! You just deciphered the mission. Can you guess what it says?
      Don't worry if not \u2014 you'll understand more words over time. For now,
      let's go complete it!"
    textoEN: 
    audioES: {fileID: 0}
    audioEN: {fileID: 0}
    condicion: 0
    parametro: 
    delaySegundos: 0
    soloDropCorrecto: 0
    elementoAResaltar: {fileID: 0}
    tipoResaltado: 0
    direccionFlecha: 0
    botonEsperado: {fileID: 0}
    bloqueoFondo: 0
  - textoES: 25. Let's actually bring the candle <sprite name="vela"> to the pumpkin
      now. But first, close the inventory by swiping down or tapping the button I'm
      pointing at.
    textoEN: 
    audioES: {fileID: 0}
    audioEN: {fileID: 0}
    condicion: 11
    parametro: 
    delaySegundos: 0
    soloDropCorrecto: 0
    elementoAResaltar: {fileID: 496359013}
    tipoResaltado: 0
    direccionFlecha: 2
    botonEsperado: {fileID: 0}
    bloqueoFondo: 0
  - textoES: 26. Now scan the candle's <sprite name="vela"> card with your camera.
      Do you remember which one it is?
    textoEN: 
    audioES: {fileID: 0}
    audioEN: {fileID: 0}
    condicion: 2
    parametro: vela_tutorial
    delaySegundos: 0
    soloDropCorrecto: 0
    elementoAResaltar: {fileID: 0}
    tipoResaltado: 0
    direccionFlecha: 0
    botonEsperado: {fileID: 0}
    bloqueoFondo: 0
  - textoES: 27. Did you see a hand appear? Tap it to grab the candle.
    textoEN: 
    audioES: {fileID: 0}
    audioEN: {fileID: 0}
    condicion: 4
    parametro: 
    delaySegundos: 0
    soloDropCorrecto: 0
    elementoAResaltar: {fileID: 1231962804}
    tipoResaltado: 0
    direccionFlecha: 0
    botonEsperado: {fileID: 1231962806}
    bloqueoFondo: 0
  - textoES: 27a. close ncandle panel
    textoEN: 
    audioES: {fileID: 0}
    audioEN: {fileID: 0}
    condicion: 9
    parametro: 
    delaySegundos: 0
    soloDropCorrecto: 0
    elementoAResaltar: {fileID: 1368369808}
    tipoResaltado: 0
    direccionFlecha: 0
    botonEsperado: {fileID: 1368369810}
    bloqueoFondo: 0
  - textoES: 28. The candle <sprite name="vela"> is with you now! Head over to the
      pumpkin's <sprite name="calabaza"> card and point at it.
    textoEN: 
    audioES: {fileID: 0}
    audioEN: {fileID: 0}
    condicion: 2
    parametro: calabaza_tutorial
    delaySegundos: 0
    soloDropCorrecto: 0
    elementoAResaltar: {fileID: 0}
    tipoResaltado: 0
    direccionFlecha: 0
    botonEsperado: {fileID: 0}
    bloqueoFondo: 0
  - textoES: 29. A hand appeared here too, see it? That means you can drop the candle
      <sprite name="vela"> onto the pumpkin <sprite name="calabaza">.
    textoEN: 
    audioES: {fileID: 0}
    audioEN: {fileID: 0}
    condicion: 5
    parametro: 
    delaySegundos: 0
    soloDropCorrecto: 0
    elementoAResaltar: {fileID: 1863500606}
    tipoResaltado: 0
    direccionFlecha: 0
    botonEsperado: {fileID: 1863500608}
    bloqueoFondo: 0
  - textoES: 30. Almost there. Now tap the button I'm pointing at to check that you
      brought what the mission needed.
    textoEN: 
    audioES: {fileID: 0}
    audioEN: {fileID: 0}
    condicion: 13
    parametro: 
    delaySegundos: 4
    soloDropCorrecto: 0
    elementoAResaltar: {fileID: 1669024230}
    tipoResaltado: 0
    direccionFlecha: 0
    botonEsperado: {fileID: 0}
    bloqueoFondo: 0
  - textoES: '32. Do you know what the mission was asking for now? That''s right:
      put the candle <sprite name="vela"> inside the pumpkin <sprite name="calabaza">.
      I think you''re ready to play on your own. '
    textoEN: 
    audioES: {fileID: 0}
    audioEN: {fileID: 0}
    condicion: 0
    parametro: 
    delaySegundos: 0
    soloDropCorrecto: 0
    elementoAResaltar: {fileID: 0}
    tipoResaltado: 0
    direccionFlecha: 0
    botonEsperado: {fileID: 0}
    bloqueoFondo: 0
  - textoES: 33. Almost forgot! See that green icon? Tap it to see all your missions.
      Right now there's only one, but once you start really playing, tons more will
      show up!
    textoEN: 
    audioES: {fileID: 0}
    audioEN: {fileID: 0}
    condicion: 15
    parametro: 
    delaySegundos: 0
    soloDropCorrecto: 0
    elementoAResaltar: {fileID: 905539755}
    tipoResaltado: 0
    direccionFlecha: 1
    botonEsperado: {fileID: 905539757}
    bloqueoFondo: 0
  - textoES: "34. One more thing: missions change color depending on their status.
      \U0001F534 Red: not available yet. \U0001F535 Blue: ready for you to decipher.
      \U0001F7E1 Yellow: already deciphered, still need to complete them with the
      camera. \U0001F7E2 Green: completed!"
    textoEN: 
    audioES: {fileID: 0}
    audioEN: {fileID: 0}
    condicion: 0
    parametro: 
    delaySegundos: 0
    soloDropCorrecto: 0
    elementoAResaltar: {fileID: 0}
    tipoResaltado: 0
    direccionFlecha: 0
    botonEsperado: {fileID: 0}
    bloqueoFondo: 0
  - textoES: 34a. close the mission list
    textoEN: 
    audioES: {fileID: 0}
    audioEN: {fileID: 0}
    condicion: 15
    parametro: 
    delaySegundos: 0
    soloDropCorrecto: 0
    elementoAResaltar: {fileID: 905539755}
    tipoResaltado: 0
    direccionFlecha: 1
    botonEsperado: {fileID: 905539757}
    bloqueoFondo: 0
  - textoES: '35. That''s everything! Now go have fun and learn a bit of Spanish
      with me. See you in the game! '
    textoEN: 
    audioES: {fileID: 0}
    audioEN: {fileID: 0}
    condicion: 0
    parametro: 
    delaySegundos: 0
    soloDropCorrecto: 0
    elementoAResaltar: {fileID: 0}
    tipoResaltado: 0
    direccionFlecha: 0
    botonEsperado: {fileID: 0}
    bloqueoFondo: 0
  panelTutorial: {fileID: 166562736}
  textoPaso: {fileID: 1535566806}
  botonSiguiente: {fileID: 807589480}
  botonRepetirAudio: {fileID: 1086362617}
  botonSaltarTutorial: {fileID: 206877266}
